==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Quaquaval|54}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Hydro Kick''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Boundaries Crossed|Keldeo|48}} from the {{TCG|Boundaries Crossed}} expansion.
*{{a|Torrent}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Quaquaval}} can have.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

